display_name = "Marina"
personality = "Marina is Orin's counterpart - where he uses line and hook, she commands great nets. She's strong as an anchor rope, weathered by salt and sun. She reads currents like others read books. She's pragmatic, superstitious in the old ways, and fiercely protective of her crew. She sings sea shanties that make fish swim into her nets - or so the islanders say."
